{"id":"f66191786120e789cc1c8e26f25668f867d8adff","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1250480","title":"Linux 同好，一起移植 win 上的软件","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"iv8d","excerpt":"Linux - @iv8d - 现在 AI 这么发达了，Linux 上移植 win 软件是不是越来越便利了。是继续发展 Wine 这类，还是直接基于 linux 底层移植好呢","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203467\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c4a8c2c0e54b9af6e5f39404479d1c26?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sir283\" data-uid=\"661572\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sir283\">sir283</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 08:46:40 +08:00\">2h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果你想要移植的那个 Windows 软件是开源的，那就可以套用 QT 这种跨平台框架，重写一个 Linux 版本，或者全平台版本，如果是闭源的，那就只能重写或者用 wine 硬改了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203609\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2273/0636/253364_normal.png?m=1749459724\" alt=\"iv8d\" data-uid=\"253364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iv8d\">iv8d</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:19:34 +08:00\">1h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>既然能重写了，国产 os 这不就起来了吗，软件市场极大丰富了，现在其实就缺那种应用商店之类的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203638\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d916/2956/417687_normal.png?m=1735628093\" alt=\"neoshui\" data-uid=\"417687\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/neoshui\">neoshui</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:25:05 +08:00\">1h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>还有很多 macOS 的优秀软件可以移植 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/L62ZP7V.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L62ZP7V.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203652\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b83e/b063/164351_normal.png?m=1458614184\" alt=\"newmlp\" data-uid=\"164351\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/newmlp\">newmlp</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:27:25 +08:00\">1h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Linux 狗都不用</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203688\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/949c/6242/379232_normal.png?m=1715334244\" alt=\"DOOMS\" data-uid=\"379232\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/DOOMS\">DOOMS</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:31:30 +08:00\">1h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>token 哪里来</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203693\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2273/0636/253364_normal.png?m=1749459724\" alt=\"iv8d\" data-uid=\"253364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iv8d\">iv8d</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:32:23 +08:00\">1h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/DOOMS\">DOOMS</a> 这么多爱好者，随着找个免费的模型蹬，就是比较花时间而已</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203702\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:33:32 +08:00\">1h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>移植需要源码，逆向费劲，直接让 AI 分析功能重写一个</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203762\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0325/5bcb/481814_normal.png?m=1739941754\" alt=\"MoeDisk\" data-uid=\"481814\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MoeDisk\">MoeDisk</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:40:37 +08:00\">1h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>眼皮浅了，搞 agentos，直接打字和电脑交流，还搞啥软件。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203785\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/78c2627704b70a5d3ef02bb96bf844db?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lxcombox\" data-uid=\"121260\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lxcombox\">lxcombox</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 09:43:30 +08:00\">1h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>国产信创体系还是有很多根源上的问题，比如不靠谱的显卡驱动（中间有一部分闭源代码无法被开源社区改进）、还遗留在旧世界上的闭源软件、各自为战的硬件架构（龙芯、兆芯、riscv 等等），以及孱弱的硬件性能。就算真的有无限 token ，在这些平台上开发软件还是困难重重</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18203924\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/badaed20b2d4dae883a1e61f11934451?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ronen\" data-uid=\"577434\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ronen\">ronen</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:01:03 +08:00\">1h 7m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/lxcombox\">lxcombox</a> 基于 x86 arm 体系建设及开源就可以了，国产硬件厂商及他们的生态有快速适配的能力。<br>参考 deepin 和 UOS ，  只要 deepin 上验证过的能力，uos 都可以在 1-2 个版本内追上来。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204116\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e4f/dad7/490065_normal.png?m=1713755027\" alt=\"selca\" data-uid=\"490065\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/selca\">selca</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:26:59 +08:00\">41 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我更喜欢 wine 这一套，把 Windows 蒸馏为 runtime 就完事</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204127\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/171d/288e/373046_normal.png?m=1714974897\" alt=\"Maboroshii\" data-uid=\"373046\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Maboroshii\">Maboroshii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:28:18 +08:00\">40 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>word excel ppt 三件套先搞定才能覆盖大多数普通 pc 用户</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18204166\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2273/0636/253364_normal.png?m=1749459724\" alt=\"iv8d\" data-uid=\"253364\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iv8d\">iv8d</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-21 10:31:28 +08:00\">36 mins ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/ronen\">ronen</a> deepin 和 uos 都是基于 linux 的吧，你说的 x86 arm 等这些属于硬件层次了，目前 linux 等也不挑硬件啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"2 sir283 2h 21m ago 如果你想要移植的那个 Windows 软件是开源的，那就可以套用 QT 这种跨平台框架，重写一个 Linux 版本，或者全平台版本，如果是闭源的，那就只能重写或者用 wine 硬改了。 4 iv8d OP 1h 48m ago 既然能重写了，国产 os 这不就起来了吗，软件市场极大丰富了，现在其实就缺那种应用商店之类的。 7 neoshui 1h 43m ago 还有很多 macOS 的优秀软件可以移植 8 newmlp 1h 40m ago Linux 狗都不用 9 DOOMS 1h 36m ago token 哪里来 11 iv8d OP 1h 36m ago @DOOMS 这么多爱好者，随着找个免费的模型蹬，就是比较花时间而已 12 layxy 1h 34m ago 移植需要源码，逆向费劲，直接让 AI 分析功能重写一个 15 MoeDisk 1h 27m ago 眼皮浅了，搞 agentos，直接打字和电脑交流，还搞啥软件。 18 lxcombox 1h 24m ago 国产信创体系还是有很多根源上的问题，比如不靠谱的显卡驱动（中间有一部分闭源代码无法被开源社区改进）、还遗留在旧世界上的闭源软件、各自为战的硬件架构（龙芯、兆芯、riscv 等等），以及孱弱的硬件性能。就算真的有无限 token ，在这些平台上开发软件还是困难重重 21 ronen 1h 7m ago 1 @lxcombox 基于 x86 arm 体系建设及开源就可以了，国产硬件厂商及他们的生态有快速适配的能力。参考 deepin 和 UOS ， 只要 deepin 上验证过的能力，uos 都可以在 1-2 个版本内追上来。 24 selca 41 mins ago 我更喜欢 wine 这一套，把 Windows 蒸馏为 runtime 就完事 25 Maboroshii 40 mins ago word excel ppt 三件套先搞定才能覆盖大多数普通 pc 用户 26 iv8d OP 36 mins ago @ronen deepin 和 uos 都是基于 linux 的吧，你说的 x86 arm 等这些属于硬件层次了，目前 linux 等也不挑硬件啊","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T03:11:34.630Z","ok":true}